: "33000", "image": "engenn4le09ob05re2img02.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn4le09ob05re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn4le09ob05re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}